Z||000005||Monkeyman||05-26-2000||11:24 AM||||Here are some more pics of the "van":<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BrubakerBox-rearinterior.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BrubakerBox-side.jpg">  <P>I think the trike is a homemade deal.  VW Beetle front end and motorcycle rear (w/motorcycle power).  You can get the plans from a website (RJ Riley something).  It's called the Tri-Magnum.  The plans 1st came out in Popular Mechanics mag a bunch of years ago.  If I had any skills, I'd make one.  Neater than bat guano!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/unknown.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/unknown-front.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/unknown-interior.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/unknown-rear.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Monkeyman (edited 05-26-2000).]||||reg||1
